/*
 * Tideline — English translations (task #129).
 *
 * Keys mirror `de.lproj/Localizable.strings` verbatim (German source
 * is the key). When the German source changes, this file MUST update
 * in the same commit or iOS will fall back to the German literal for
 * EN-locale users.
 *
 * Translation principles:
 *   - Recognition framing over instruction ("you're in your luteal
 *     phase", not "you should...")
 *   - Plain language, no marketing-speak
 *   - DACH terminology when no clean EN equivalent exists (e.g.
 *     "Apple Health" stays "Apple Health" in both)
 *   - du-form in German maps to "you" — informal register preserved
 */

